    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"CQC registered · More than 40 years combined experience\",\"title\":\"Meet our circumcision practitioners\",\"lede\":\"Our two practitioners have more than 40 years of combined experience in the UK and abroad and have carried out thousands of circumcisions across different age groups.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Our team\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The clinic's work includes baby and infant circumcision, circumcision for children and teenagers, adult circumcision, medical foreskin problems, re-circumcision and practitioner training.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Procedures are carried out in a dedicated clinical environment with attention to infection control, consent, anaesthesia, aftercare and follow-up.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm bg-card edge\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Why patients choose the clinic\",\"heading\":\"What we provide\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"CQC registered\",\"body\":\"A dedicated circumcision service in a registered clinical environment.\"},{\"title\":\"Experienced practitioners\",\"body\":\"More than 40 years of combined experience in the UK and abroad.\"},{\"title\":\"Age-appropriate methods\",\"body\":\"Methods chosen according to age, anatomy and clinical circumstances.\"},{\"title\":\"Aftercare and follow-up\",\"body\":\"Comprehensive written aftercare and follow-up support during healing.\"},{\"title\":\"Letters\",\"body\":\"GP, school and work letters where appropriate.\"},{\"title\":\"Location\",\"body\":\"North-West London location with public transport links.\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"haidar\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\" id=\"haidar\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"dr-haidar\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eCircumcision lead\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-1\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-1\">Dr Haidar Al-Ali</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p class=\"caps\" style=\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.06em\">BDS · MFDS RCPS (Glasg)</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dr Al-Ali qualified from King's College London in 2013 and carries out the great majority of the\r\n          circumcisions performed at this clinic, for babies, boys and adults alike.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>He also trains other doctors in circumcision technique. That is a more useful description of where this\r\n          clinic's experience comes from than any claim we could make about ourselves: the technique is taught here,\r\n          which means it gets examined and defended rather than simply repeated.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue);display:block;margin-bottom:14px\\u0022\\u003eQualification and registration\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cdl class=\\u0022spec\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003c/dl\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eQualified\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eBDS, King's College London, 2013\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eMembership\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eMFDS, RCPS Glasgow\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eRegister\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eGeneral Dental Council (UK)\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eTeaches\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eCircumcision technique to other practitioners\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eLanguages\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eEnglish, Arabic\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"samir\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"samir\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":true} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split reverse\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003ePlastic surgeon\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-1\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-1\">Mr Samir Al-Ali</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p class=\"caps\" style=\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.06em\">MB ChB · FICMS · MRCS Ed</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mr Al-Ali is a board-certified plastic surgeon with more than 35 years in practice. At this clinic he\r\n          takes the more complex adult work: revision of an earlier circumcision, cases with significant scarring,\r\n          and anything where the reconstruction needs a plastic surgeon's hands.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>He also runs the cosmetic surgery side of the practice at\r\n          <a href=\"https://www.beverleyclinic.co.uk\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Beverley Clinic</a>, which is the same building.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue);display:block;margin-bottom:14px\\u0022\\u003eRegistration and membership\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cdl class=\\u0022spec\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003c/dl\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eMedical register\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eGeneral Medical Council (UK)\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eAlso registered\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eDubai Health Authority, Kuwait MoH\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eFellowship\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eRoyal College of Surgeons of Edinburgh\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eMember\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eBritish College of Aesthetic Medicine\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdt class=\\u0022k\\u0022\\u003eMember\\u003c/dt\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\t\\u003cdd class=\\u0022v\\u0022\\u003eEuropean College of Aesthetic Medicine \\u0026amp; Surgery\\u003c/dd\\u003e\\n\\t\\t\\u003c/li\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:15px\">You can check any UK doctor yourself on the <a href=\"https://www.gmc-uk.org/registration-and-licensing/the-medical-register\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:var(--blue-deep)\">GMC medical register</a>. Ask us for the registration number at your consultation and we will give it to you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"dr-samir\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/trust-strip /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Meet whoever would be doing it\",\"text\":\"The consultation is where you find out whether the procedure is right, what it costs in writing, and who is holding the instrument. Nothing is booked until you say so.\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
}
